WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.291
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:35.000
Lord Krishna clarified the
characteristics of the karma yogi

3
00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:38.000
whose divine consciousness has
been awakened.

4
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.833
Subsequently, the question arises

5
00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:44.250
about the fate of the actions
of a selfless Karma Yogi,

6
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.333
because if there are actions,

7
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:48.291
there will also be bondage.

8
00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:50.000
In this verse, Lord Krishna

9
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.291
is answering this very question.

10
00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:55.458
He states that a person who
performs actions without attachment

11
00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:57.166
and offers the fruits

12
00:00:57.166 --> 00:00:59.500
of their actions to the Supreme Lord

13
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.666
remains untouched by any sin.

14
00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:11.541
The bondage of performed actions is inevitable;

15
00:01:11.541 --> 00:01:15.875
every action comes with its 
sinful or virtuous fruits as well.

16
00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.291
But what if you dedicate

17
00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:19.125
your actions to God,

18
00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:23.083
if you have no attachment left to
the fruits of your actions,

19
00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.041
then what will happen to these?

20
00:01:25.041 --> 00:01:28.916
Lord Krishna, giving the answer to this, 
he explains that 

21
00:01:28.916 --> 00:01:33.458
just as a lotus flower is 
undoubtedly situated in water,

22
00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:36.541
but the water can neither

23
00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:37.833
stay on the lotus leaves

24
00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:40.583
nor can it make them wet.

25
00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:44.666
Rather, the water flows down from them.

26
00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:46.875
Similarly, a Karma Yogi

27
00:01:46.875 --> 00:01:50.333
when they dedicate the fruits of
their actions to God,

28
00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:53.166
that yogi remains in this world,

29
00:01:53.166 --> 00:01:55.041
performs their actions,

30
00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:58.500
but does not get entangled in the 
world's complexities.

31
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.041
They remain untouched

32
00:02:00.041 --> 00:02:03.750
by both sinful and virtuous fruits.

33
00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.500
That's why such a yogi also

34
00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:09.375
remains free from the bondage of their actions.

35
00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:10.333
Lord Krishna

36
00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:11.541
is for all of us

37
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:14.500
presenting a practical framework.

38
00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.500
He is making us understand that for liberation

39
00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.416
and spiritual progress, there is no need

40
00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:22.541
to renounce our actions.

41
00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:27.416
The need is only to change our perspective.

42
00:02:27.416 --> 00:02:31.166
You will remember that in the 
first chapter, Arjuna while

43
00:02:31.166 --> 00:02:33.541
clarifying the dilemma of his own mind,

44
00:02:33.541 --> 00:02:34.708
said that

45
00:02:34.708 --> 00:02:37.625
if he kills his own people,

46
00:02:37.625 --> 00:02:40.333
he will be a recipient of sinful fruits.

47
00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:47.041
But in these verses, Lord Krishna is showing Arjuna
such a path of action by which

48
00:02:47.041 --> 00:02:52.875
Arjuna can remain completely free from sin
even while fighting a fierce war.

49
00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:54.791
In a way, it is seen that

50
00:02:54.791 --> 00:02:56.458
Krishna is encouraging Arjuna

51
00:02:56.458 --> 00:03:00.125
to become like a lotus flower.

52
00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:08.500
While living in this world,

53
00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:12.833
you face many such situations

54
00:03:12.833 --> 00:03:17.291
that emotionally hurt you.

55
00:03:17.291 --> 00:03:20.833
Such as a negative environment

56
00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:25.625
harsh words spoken by someone, 
professional failure,

57
00:03:25.625 --> 00:03:30.125
or conflicts occurring in personal life.

58
00:03:30.125 --> 00:03:31.833
However,

59
00:03:31.833 --> 00:03:34.583
just as on a lotus flower

60
00:03:34.583 --> 00:03:38.000
a water droplet cannot stay,

61
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:44.916
in the same way, despite being 
amidst negativity and conflict,

62
00:03:44.916 --> 00:03:50.375
you too can move forward in life 
without being affected by them. 

63
00:03:50.375 --> 00:03:59.208
This is only possible when you see 
yourself in a spiritual perspective. 

64
00:03:59.208 --> 00:04:03.083
When you perform your actions knowing that

65
00:04:03.083 --> 00:04:12.458
you are not the sole doer but merely an 
instrument in God's plan,

66
00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:18.208
then you start looking at life from 
a different perspective.

67
00:04:18.208 --> 00:04:25.750
you understand that the events happening 
around you are temporary,

68
00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:31.583
but you are the soul, which is eternal.

69
00:04:31.583 --> 00:04:32.833
And for this reason,

70
00:04:32.833 --> 00:04:40.791
how can temporary circumstances 
affect the permanent soul?

71
00:04:40.791 --> 00:04:43.708
Established in this truth,

72
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:48.458
perform your actions with a sense of duty.

73
00:04:48.458 --> 00:04:50.500
Whatever challenges come,

74
00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:54.166
face them with positivity

75
00:04:54.166 --> 00:04:57.083
and in this way, by doing actions

76
00:04:57.083 --> 00:05:00.875
with detachment, rise above

77
00:05:00.875 --> 00:05:03.875
the emotional ups and downs

78
00:05:03.875 --> 00:05:05.875
of life.

79
00:05:10.583 --> 00:05:13.083
Many times in a family,

80
00:05:13.083 --> 00:05:16.041
regarding household chores,

81
00:05:16.041 --> 00:05:20.666
quarrels, conflicts or disagreements occur.

82
00:05:20.666 --> 00:05:23.541
All household work is only possible

83
00:05:23.541 --> 00:05:27.875
when it is divided among the members.

84
00:05:27.875 --> 00:05:30.000
In such a situation, many members

85
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.500
are assigned tasks

86
00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:37.000
that they do not want to do at all.

87
00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.500
Working without the heart, due to

88
00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:44.500
despair or disappointment, often

89
00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:48.500
leads to a situation of dispute.

90
00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:51.541
Does this happen with you too?

91
00:05:51.541 --> 00:05:53.083
There is a remedy

92
00:05:53.083 --> 00:05:57.666
by which you may be able to 
remove this very big cause

93
00:05:57.666 --> 00:06:01.000
of family discord.

94
00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:05.291
This remedy is a two-pronged process.

95
00:06:05.291 --> 00:06:07.666
First, that every

96
00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:11.791
work must be done free from ego.

97
00:06:11.791 --> 00:06:16.000
When you are engaged in work free from ego,

98
00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.291
then only duty remains.

99
00:06:19.291 --> 00:06:22.833
not you or the action. 

100
00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:26.208
Then work is done with a spirit of service.

101
00:06:26.208 --> 00:06:29.666
Without expecting any kind of
personal interest, respect

102
00:06:29.666 --> 00:06:31.291
or any kind of

103
00:06:31.291 --> 00:06:35.208
appreciation.

104
00:06:35.208 --> 00:06:36.875
And of this process

105
00:06:36.875 --> 00:06:40.041
the second part is

106
00:06:40.041 --> 00:06:43.625
that after doing every work,

107
00:06:43.625 --> 00:06:47.750
it should be dedicated to God.

108
00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:52.000
When actions are dedicated to God,

109
00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.500
they are not counted.

110
00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:59.250
Then this feeling automatically ends

111
00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.750
that my husband,

112
00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:04.208
wife, or brother did only this much work,

113
00:07:04.208 --> 00:07:06.750
so why should I do more than that.

114
00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:09.666
To this I say

115
00:07:09.666 --> 00:07:14.083
that every member of the family should, 
free from ego,

116
00:07:14.083 --> 00:07:19.125
dedicate their every action to God.

117
00:07:19.125 --> 00:07:26.208
Then this two-pronged process will 
become a powerful impenetrable armor.

118
00:07:26.208 --> 00:07:30.166
Just as over the lotus flower

119
00:07:30.166 --> 00:07:34.291
water flows without any obstruction,

120
00:07:34.291 --> 00:07:37.041
similarly feelings of negativity

121
00:07:37.041 --> 00:07:40.875
or discord will not be able to cause

122
00:07:40.875 --> 00:07:43.875
any harm to such an armor.

123
00:07:48.333 --> 00:07:49.000
In the professional

124
00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:52.250
world, ups and downs are common.

125
00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.541
Sometimes success or failure,

126
00:07:54.541 --> 00:07:57.208
sometimes praise or rebuke.

127
00:07:57.208 --> 00:08:00.583
Sometimes the project will move 
forward at a fast pace

128
00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:04.708
and sometimes it will stop due to some obstacle.

129
00:08:04.708 --> 00:08:09.000
You are also a part of the professional world,

130
00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:16.625
so how will you remain untouched 
by these events?

131
00:08:16.625 --> 00:08:23.583
daily instability, this 
emotional roller coaster in business?

132
00:08:23.583 --> 00:08:26.583
do you get tired of it?

133
00:08:26.583 --> 00:08:31.208
There is a way to rise above it, and that is

134
00:08:31.208 --> 00:08:35.750
when you connect with your spiritual truth.

135
00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:38.416
Considering yourself as the soul,

136
00:08:38.416 --> 00:08:40.625
considering action as duty

137
00:08:40.625 --> 00:08:44.791
and dedicating the fruits of action to God—

138
00:08:44.791 --> 00:08:49.833
then you will be free from the effects of results.

139
00:08:49.833 --> 00:08:52.000
Praise or rebuke

140
00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.416
received at work

141
00:08:53.416 --> 00:08:57.791
happens to your ego, body and mind.

142
00:08:57.791 --> 00:09:02.500
The soul is a witness, it remains 
untouched by all this.

143
00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:06.750
Through this transparent glass of spirituality,

144
00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:11.041
when you look at the world, you will find

145
00:09:11.041 --> 00:09:15.250
that the whole scene changes.

146
00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:19.708
It may happen that after tremendous efforts,

147
00:09:19.708 --> 00:09:21.833
the project fails.

148
00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:27.291
Or, even after being successful, 
you do not get adequate credit.

149
00:09:27.291 --> 00:09:31.333
In both situations, you will remain neutral.

150
00:09:31.333 --> 00:09:35.041
When criticized, you will not be distressed.

151
00:09:35.041 --> 00:09:36.500
Accepting it,

152
00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:39.375
you will improve your process.

153
00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:44.041
When praised, you will not come into 
a state of pride.

154
00:09:44.041 --> 00:09:46.500
You will engage in the next duty.

155
00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:49.833
Fame and infamy received at work

156
00:09:49.833 --> 00:09:53.000
will become normal parts of business,

157
00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:57.250
because your focus is now on the main objective.

158
00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:58.666
Therefore,

159
00:09:58.666 --> 00:10:02.375
your dedication is towards duty,

160
00:10:02.375 --> 00:10:04.500
not towards the result.

161
00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.625
Such a spiritual perspective

162
00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:10.833
will make you like a lotus flower.

163
00:10:10.833 --> 00:10:14.750
Just as water flows over it,

164
00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:18.666
you too will remain untouched by the praise

165
00:10:18.666 --> 00:10:22.750
or insult received.
